                      govern how `PdxFsDirEntry@0.1` evolves.
!ref libpdx-audit  -- the DirListRecord frame ls opens/commits.

!section version

1.0.0 -- R50 Wave-2 core-utility line. Byte-frozen: the argv
surface, the exit-code map, and the 144-byte `PdxFsDirEntry@0.1`
wire body do not change on the 1.x line. See `CHANGELOG.md` for
the 0.1..1.0 progression and the 1.x additive-only rules.
